 its absolute limit. Every corner, every overtake \u2014 felt in full VR.\n\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f Three Hand-Crafted Circuits\nThree tracks built ground-up for VR \u2014 tight street sections, sweeping high-speed corners, and technical infields that challenge every skill level.\n\ud83c\udfae True VR \u2014 No Compromises\nDesigned exclusively for Meta Quest. Motion controller steering, a detailed working cockpit, and comfort settings tuned to keep you racing longer.\n\ud83e\udd16 Single Player Career\nEscalating AI difficulty, career events, achievements, and leaderboards. From first lap to podium finisher.\n\ud83c\udf0d Global Multiplayer\nReal-time wheel-to-wheel racing against drivers worldwide. Draft, defend, and fight for the win.\n\u26a1 Realistic Handling\nTire management, slipstreaming, late braking \u2014 deep enough to reward precision, accessible enough from lap one.\nAt a Glance: 3 VR circuits \u00b7 Open-wheel cockpit \u00b7 Motion controller steering \u00b7 Career mode \u00b7 Global multiplayer \u00b7 Car customization \u00b7 Leaderboards\nBuckle up. The lights are out. Go.", "short_description": "Strap into the cockpit and feel true speed. Formula Velocity VR puts you behind the wheel of open-wheel formula cars across 3 hand-crafted circuits \u2014 with realistic physics, AI rivals, and pulse-pounding multiplayer. Built exclusively for VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gravitylabs1.wixsite.com/website-1", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Gravity Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://gravitylabs1.wixsite.com/website-1", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "673385183287495"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "